Gershwin WindowManager
======================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-windowmanager.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = 10b6797a3bfd391d559820232805f1a107fa9ec3
date   = 2026-09-17

This revision is built by tools/desktop/build-windowmanager.sh, which
foxyn-desktop(8) runs on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop):
it downloads the revision's archive and checks its SHA-256, with
tools/desktop/patches/windowmanager-titlebar-state.txt. It is
not part of buildworld. Keep build output outside the submodule. When
upgrading, update the revision and checksum in build-windowmanager.sh too.

An external experimental patch was tested; the clean submodule is unmodified and does not include that fix.

License: MIT in WindowManager/LICENSE; XCBKit and icon provenance require the review in docs/desktop-windowmanager.md. Complete file-level and asset provenance review and preserve
applicable notices and source obligations before distribution.

When upgrading, review dependencies, API and ABI compatibility, FoxynBSD
portability, license notices and the full desktop build and runtime tests.
